WEBVTT

00:00:07.995 --> 00:00:10.748
(panting)

00:00:10.832 --> 00:00:13.251
(voice grunts)

00:00:13.334 --> 00:00:14.585
(thump)

00:00:14.669 --> 00:00:16.629
(voices laughing)

00:00:16.713 --> 00:00:18.756
VOICE 4: There is no escape.
你逃不掉的

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:20.633
-VOICE 1: Well put.
-VOICE 2: Scary.
-说得好
-老实点

00:00:20.717 --> 00:00:22.260
-VOICE 3: Yeah.
-What are you?
你们是谁？

00:00:22.343 --> 00:00:24.762
VOICE 1: We are terrifying
invisible beasts.
我们是威震天下的隐形人

00:00:24.846 --> 00:00:27.515
VOICE 4: If you could see us,
you would be really intimidated.
看到我们的人都会被活活吓死

00:00:27.598 --> 00:00:28.975
-VOICE 2: Yeah.
-VOICE 3: Yeah.
看到我们的人都会被活活吓死

00:00:29.058 --> 00:00:31.853
VOICE 1: Uh, you forgot to
mention that we are very large!
你忘了告诉她，我们是巨人

00:00:31.936 --> 00:00:33.938
-Well, what do you want?
-VOICE 4: You.
-你们想要什么？
-要你

00:00:34.021 --> 00:00:35.231
You'll do what we ask.
你必须听我们的话

00:00:35.314 --> 00:00:37.024
-VOICE 1: She will.
-VOICE 3: Very clear.
-她会的
-当然

00:00:37.108 --> 00:00:38.609
-VOICE 2: Well put.
-VOICE 3: Yeah.
说得好

00:00:39.902 --> 00:00:42.321
-Or what?
-VOICE 4: Or death.
死路一条

00:00:42.405 --> 00:00:43.990
ALL: Death? Death?! Death?
死路…

00:00:44.073 --> 00:00:46.576
(chanting) Death! Death! Death! Death!
死路…

00:00:46.659 --> 00:00:48.536
Death! Death! Death!
死路…

00:00:48.619 --> 00:00:51.914
Well, I wouldn't be much use
to you dead, now, would I?
我死了你们就白忙了，对吗？

00:00:51.998 --> 00:00:53.791
VOICE 4: I hadn't thought of that.
这我还没想过

00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:56.127
-VOICE 2: No, you hadn't.
-VOICE 3: Fair point.
还没想过

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.422
VOICE 1: All right.
Then we'll just kill your friends.
好吧，那我就杀死你的朋友们

00:00:59.505 --> 00:01:01.883
(voices oohing)
好吧，那我就杀死你的朋友们

00:01:01.966 --> 00:01:03.468
-VOICE 2: Good idea.
-VOICE 3: Yeah.
好主意

00:01:03.551 --> 00:01:05.219
What do you want with me?
你们要我干什么？

00:01:05.303 --> 00:01:09.390
VOICE 4: You will enter
the house of the Oppressor.
你必须去迫害狂家里…

00:01:09.474 --> 00:01:11.184
What house?
谁家？

00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:12.477
VOICE 4: This one.
就是这儿

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:14.604
(latch rattles, door thuds)
就是这儿

00:01:19.776 --> 00:01:23.863
VOICE 4: Upstairs, you'll find
the Book of Incantations.
你在楼上可以找到《咒语密笈》

00:01:23.946 --> 00:01:27.033
Recite the spell
that makes the unseen seen.
里面的咒语能让隐形者显形

00:01:27.116 --> 00:01:28.951
VOICE 3: Well put, Chief. Well put.
说得好，头儿，说得好

00:01:29.035 --> 00:01:31.287
-Very good.
-Yeah. Yeah!
真好

00:01:31.370 --> 00:01:32.955
(birds chirping)
真好

00:01:33.039 --> 00:01:35.124
VOICE 3: Well, go on.
We haven't got all day.
快点去
我们等不及了

00:01:35.208 --> 00:01:37.001
VOICE 4: Remember what
will happen to your friends.
别忘了你的朋友们

00:01:37.085 --> 00:01:38.836
VOICE 1: You've been warned.
别说没警告过你

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:40.129
-Yeah.
-Yeah.
没错

00:01:40.213 --> 00:01:43.049
-Right.
-Right.
没错

00:01:43.132 --> 00:01:44.300
Yeah.
没错

00:01:44.384 --> 00:01:45.802
Why don't you do it yourselves?
你们为什么不自己去？

00:01:46.761 --> 00:01:48.304
VOICE 4: We can't read.
因为我们是文盲

00:01:48.388 --> 00:01:50.431
VOICE 1: Can't write, either,
as a matter of fact.
不会写，顺便说一句

00:01:51.349 --> 00:01:53.226
-VOICE 2: Or add.
-VOICE 3: Yeah.
也不会算

00:01:55.019 --> 00:01:56.979
Why didn't you just say so?
干嘛不早说？

00:01:57.647 --> 00:01:59.440
VOICE 4: Beware the Oppressor.
我们担心迫害狂发现

00:01:59.524 --> 00:02:01.317
VOICE 1: He's very oppressive.
他太厉害了

00:02:01.401 --> 00:02:05.113
VOICE 4: What makes
the unseen seen-- got it?
“让隐形者显形”，明白吗？

00:02:05.196 --> 00:02:06.864
-VOICE 1: Don't forget.
-VOICE 2: Don't forget that.
别忘了

00:02:06.948 --> 00:02:08.324
VOICE 3: Yeah.
-千万别忘了
-很好，没错

00:02:12.703 --> 00:02:15.373
(door thuds, echoing)

00:02:19.919 --> 00:02:21.045
Ed.
埃德

00:02:22.255 --> 00:02:24.006
-Ed, wake up.
-Huh?
埃德，醒醒

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:25.633
Wake up. Look.
醒醒，你看

00:02:34.559 --> 00:02:36.102
Where's Lucy?
露西呢？

00:02:36.185 --> 00:02:37.729
Lucy?
露西

00:02:37.812 --> 00:02:40.189
-Lucy!
-CASPIAN: Everybody up!
露西

00:02:40.857 --> 00:02:42.775
Get up. Get up, I said!
起来

00:02:44.819 --> 00:02:46.404
-This way.
-DRINIAN: Look lively.
这边

00:02:46.487 --> 00:02:47.822
Move, you blaggards!
动作快点，大懒虫

00:02:51.451 --> 00:02:53.369
(snoring loudly)

00:02:57.123 --> 00:02:58.833
(footsteps echoing)

00:03:08.009 --> 00:03:10.011
(footsteps echoing)

00:03:18.019 --> 00:03:19.729
(grunting)

00:03:25.193 --> 00:03:27.612
(blows)

00:03:50.927 --> 00:03:54.430
"With these words your tongue must sew
“念动这些咒语
你的舌头将感觉麻木

00:03:54.514 --> 00:03:57.683
for all around there to be snow."
顷刻间会大雪纷飞”

00:04:01.396 --> 00:04:02.772
(gasps)

00:04:30.174 --> 00:04:31.634
(blows)

00:04:36.055 --> 00:04:38.891
(eerie, overlapping voices
whispering indistinctly)

00:04:47.567 --> 00:04:51.279
"An infallible spell to make you she,
“这个灵验的咒语

00:04:51.362 --> 00:04:53.531
the beauty you've always wanted to be."
想要的美丽？”

00:05:04.375 --> 00:05:05.918
Susan, what's going...
苏珊，这是…

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:08.838
...on?
怎么了？

00:05:13.885 --> 00:05:15.511
I'm beautiful.
我变漂亮了

00:05:27.774 --> 00:05:29.150
No! Wait.
不，等等

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:33.029
"Make me she, whom I'd agree..."
这正是我想要的

00:05:38.034 --> 00:05:39.827
(roaring)

00:05:42.163 --> 00:05:43.706
-ASLAN: Lucy.
-(gasps)
露西

00:05:44.665 --> 00:05:47.043
-Lucy.
-Aslan?
露西

00:05:48.669 --> 00:05:49.837
Aslan.
阿斯兰

00:05:58.304 --> 00:06:00.264
(eerie voices whispering)

00:06:04.852 --> 00:06:07.730
"A spell to make the unseen seen.
“让隐形者显形的咒语

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:12.193
Like the 'P' in psychology,
所谓的隐形者

00:06:12.276 --> 00:06:14.445
the 'H' in psychiatry,
就如同单词中不发音的字母

00:06:14.529 --> 00:06:17.281
invisible ink and the truth
in theology..."
或者是神学中蕴涵的真谛”

00:06:17.365 --> 00:06:18.699
Caspian, Lucy's dagger.
或者是神学中蕴涵的真谛”

00:06:24.789 --> 00:06:27.500
VOICE 4: Stop right there or perish.
谁敢轻举妄动，必死无疑

00:06:27.583 --> 00:06:29.252
(thumping)
谁敢轻举妄动，必死无疑

00:06:29.335 --> 00:06:32.463
(crewmen groaning)

00:06:32.547 --> 00:06:34.340
"The spell is complete.
“咒语到此结束

00:06:35.633 --> 00:06:37.427
Now all is visible."
全体隐形者显形”

00:06:40.638 --> 00:06:42.640
(rattling, squeaking)

00:06:42.724 --> 00:06:44.392
(gasps)

00:06:46.227 --> 00:06:48.938
-(footsteps)
-(liquid rippling)

